WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.735 --> 00:00:13.583
Roxy landed.

2
00:00:13.584 --> 00:00:16.936
Zombies stumbled out of Shop Well Supermarket.

3
00:00:16.937 --> 00:00:19.744
Crumbs were stuck to their mouths.

4
00:00:19.745 --> 00:00:23.858
Roxy saw a Le Sweet wrapper stuck to one zombie.

5
00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:28.814
Roxy gasped. "That zombie is the Mighty Man actor!"

6
00:00:28.815 --> 00:00:30.924
People were running and shouting.

7
00:00:30.925 --> 00:00:38.210
"Ahh! Zombies!" an old man cried.

8
00:00:38.211 --> 00:00:41.108
Three teenagers started to race away.

9
00:00:41.109 --> 00:00:43.492
Then one held up his phone.

10
00:00:43.493 --> 00:00:47.264
"I'm going to take a selfie with—Ahh!"

11
00:00:47.265 --> 00:00:52.735
"Grargh!" The Mighty Man zombie chomped the phone and then spit it out.

12
00:00:52.736 --> 00:00:55.280
The boy ran after his friends.

13
00:00:55.281 --> 00:00:58.366
Roxy saw several people huddled on top of a cab.

14
00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:05.285
"Rocket Girl, save us!" Zombies reached up, grabbing at the people.

15
00:01:05.286 --> 00:01:08.354
An old man swung his cane at the zombies.

16
00:01:08.355 --> 00:01:11.879
"Get away from us, you monsters!"

17
00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.553
Zoom! Roxy shot through the air.

18
00:01:14.554 --> 00:01:17.049
She blew her super breath.

19
00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:20.690
The zombies tumbled and rolled over each other.

20
00:01:20.691 --> 00:01:23.193
"Run!" Roxy told the people.

21
00:01:23.194 --> 00:01:28.858
"Find somewhere to hide. I'll be back soon!"

22
00:01:28.859 --> 00:01:31.925
Roxy flew to Le Sweet's Bakery.

23
00:01:31.926 --> 00:01:35.073
Inside, huge ovens lined one wall.

24
00:01:35.074 --> 00:01:37.667
Machines hummed loudly.

25
00:01:37.668 --> 00:01:41.626
Long belts filled with donuts rolled along slowly.

26
00:01:41.627 --> 00:01:44.475
One machine squirted icing onto donuts.

27
00:01:44.476 --> 00:01:48.208
Another machine dunked donuts into a tub of chocolate.

28
00:01:48.209 --> 00:01:50.627
"I have to shut this place down.

29
00:01:50.628 --> 00:01:56.296
It's making donuts—and zombies!"

30
00:01:56.297 --> 00:02:00.643
Roxy turned everything off.

31
00:02:00.644 --> 00:02:04.383
The bakery became still and silent.

32
00:02:04.384 --> 00:02:08.061
A second later Roxy heard footsteps.

33
00:02:08.062 --> 00:02:12.471
A man with an apron and a tall white hat hurried in.

34
00:02:12.472 --> 00:02:15.839
"What happened?" he cried.

35
00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:19.919
Then he spotted Roxy. "Rocket Girl!"

36
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.371
"Sorry, sir," Roxy said.

37
00:02:22.372 --> 00:02:23.988
"You might not know this.

38
00:02:23.989 --> 00:02:28.410
But your donuts are causing a big problem. You see—"

39
00:02:28.411 --> 00:02:33.666
"You think you can stop me, do you?" The man glared at Roxy.

40
00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:36.473
"Huh?" Roxy was confused.

41
00:02:36.474 --> 00:02:37.897
The man continued.

42
00:02:37.898 --> 00:02:40.473
"My name is Pete Le Sweet.

43
00:02:40.474 --> 00:02:43.146
I invented a special donut recipe.

44
00:02:43.147 --> 00:02:48.466
It's so good, everybody will be hungry for one thing—my donuts!"

45
00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:53.970
He laughed. "And you won't stop me, Rocket Girl!"

46
00:02:53.971 --> 00:02:55.699
Roxy narrowed her eyes.

47
00:02:55.700 --> 00:03:01.034
"You planned to turn people into zombies? It wasn't an accident?"

48
00:03:01.035 --> 00:03:05.407
Le Sweet raised an eyebrow. "Huh? Zombies?"

49
00:03:05.408 --> 00:03:07.522
Roxy put her hands on her hips.

50
00:03:07.523 --> 00:03:10.872
"Your special recipe stinks, Le Sweet.

51
00:03:10.873 --> 00:03:14.588
Your donuts are turning people into zombies!"

52
00:03:14.589 --> 00:03:16.227
Le Sweet shrugged.

53
00:03:16.228 --> 00:03:19.594
"As long as I'm selling lots of donuts, who cares?"

54
00:03:19.595 --> 00:03:21.418
He put his hand on a lever.

55
00:03:21.419 --> 00:03:23.988
"Good-bye, Rocket Girl."

56
00:03:23.989 --> 00:03:27.130
Le Sweet pulled the lever.

57
00:03:27.131 --> 00:03:34.011
Chocolate syrup rushed out, completely covering Roxy!
